656
01:00:40,035 --> 01:00:42,162
I'll get it.

657
01:00:58,654 --> 01:01:01,919
Hi, Mr. And Mrs. Banks.
Hi, nice to meet you.

658
01:01:02,858 --> 01:01:05,294
Nice to meet you, too.

659
01:01:05,394 --> 01:01:07,329
