- Didn't think so.

735
01:07:59,007 --> 01:08:01,109
I'm worried about Cody.

736
01:08:01,209 --> 01:08:03,678
- What.
- We haven't heard a peep out of him.

737
01:08:03,778 --> 01:08:06,440
- Who?
- Maybe I was a little hard on him.

738
